      <description><![CDATA[
<p>Mac only; no iPhone/iPad release (the Unreleased entry above ships with the next companion release).</p>
<h3>Added</h3>
<ul><li>Move panes within a workspace, to another workspace or into a new one, with what runs in them (#218): drag the grip that appears at a pane's top edge onto another pane's edge (split there) or centre (swap), onto a workspace in the sidebar, or out of the window (new workspace); Pane › Swap with Pane Left / Right / Up / Down (⌥⇧⌘ + arrow keys), Move to Workspace…, Move to New Workspace; <code>cmds pane move</code> / <code>cmds pane swap</code> and <code>pane.move</code> / <code>pane.swap</code>.</li></ul>
      ]]></description>
